---

---

<section class="hero" id="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-name">
  <!-- ── Ambient background ───────────────────────────── -->
  <div class="hero__ambient" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="ambient__glow"></div>
    <div class="ambient__grid"></div>
    <div class="ambient__bottom-rule"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- ── Left: Text content ───────────────────────────── -->
  <div class="hero__content">
    <div class="hero__eyebrow">
      <span class="eyebrow__dash"></span>
      <span class="eyebrow__text">ESPECIALISTA EN MARKETING</span>
      <span class="eyebrow__sep" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <span class="eyebrow__text">CREADORA DE CONTENIDO</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="hero__name" id="hero-name">VALENTINA</h1>

    <div class="hero__bio-block">
      <span class="hero__bio-label">SOBRE MÍ</span>
      <span class="hero__location">
        <svg class="hero__location-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M12 2C8.13 2 5 5.13 5 9c0 5.25 7 13 7 13s7-7.75 7-13c0-3.87-3.13-7-7-7z"/>
          <circle cx="12" cy="9" r="2.5"/>
        </svg>
        BOGOTÁ, COLOMBIA
      </span>
      <p class="hero__bio-lead">"Apasionada por crear estrategias que conectan."</p>
      <p class="hero__bio">
        Combina creatividad, análisis y estrategia para construir marcas que dejan huella. <strong>Profesional
        en Marketing</strong>, con experiencia combinando estrategia de comunicación,
        creación de contenido y diseño aplicado al marketing, tanto en marcas
        comerciales como en un entorno institucional.<br><br> Mi trabajo no se limita a
        publicar: parto de entender el objetivo de una marca —su público, su
        mensaje, su contexto— para luego traducirlo en contenido, piezas y
        campañas que realmente comuniquen algo. <br><br> He trabajado desde la
        conceptualización de una identidad de marca hasta la ejecución de piezas
        para redes sociales, campañas y comunicación institucional. <br><br>Lo que me
        diferencia: puedo moverme con la misma solidez entre un brief comercial de
        una marca que necesita posicionarse y un entorno institucional donde la
        comunicación exige precisión, formalidad y claridad. Esa versatilidad es
        la base de cómo trabajo.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="hero__skills" role="list" aria-label="Habilidades principales">
      <span class="skill" role="listitem">SEO / SEM</span>
      <span class="skill" role="listitem">Analítica</span>
      <span class="skill" role="listitem">Estrategia de Marca</span>
      <span class="skill" role="listitem">Creación de Contenido</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ── Right: Abstract visual (sin foto) ────────────── -->
  <div class="hero__visual" aria-hidden="true">
    <!-- Orbiting system -->
    <div class="orb">
      <div class="orb__core"></div>
      <div class="orb__ring orb__ring--inner"></div>
      <div class="orb__ring orb__ring--outer"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Floating metric cards -->
    <div class="metric metric--roi">
      <span class="metric__accent"></span>
      <span class="metric__value">Multisector</span>
      <span class="metric__label">Marcas | Servicios | Sector público</span>
    </div>

    <div class="metric metric--brands">
      <span class="metric__accent"></span>
      <span class="metric__value">End to end</span>
      <span class="metric__label">Estrategia | Contenido | Diseño</span>
    </div>

    <div class="metric metric--growth">
      <span class="metric__accent"></span>
      <span class="metric__value">Desde cero</span>
      <span class="metric__label">Identidad | Branding | Contenido</span>
    </div>
  </div>

</section>

<style>
  /* ── Hero container ──────────────────────────────────── */
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding-top: calc(var(--nav-height) + clamp(40px, 6vh, 80px));
    padding-left: var(--margin-desktop);
    padding-right: var(--margin-desktop);
    padding-bottom: clamp(24px, 4vh, 48px);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* ── Ambient background ──────────────────────────────── */
  .hero__ambient {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .ambient__glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: -15%;
    right: -8%;
    width: 62%;
    height: 90%;
    background: radial-gradient(
      ellipse 55% 70% at 60% 35%,
      rgba(220, 20, 60, 0.13) 0%,
      rgba(220, 20, 60, 0.05) 45%,
      transparent 72%
    );
    animation: glowDrift 12s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .ambient__grid {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.022) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.022) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 58px 58px;
    mask-image: radial-gradient(
      ellipse 65% 75% at 72% 52%,
      rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9) 0%,
      transparent 80%
    );
    -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(
      ellipse 65% 75% at 72% 52%,
      rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9) 0%,
      transparent 80%
    );
  }

  .ambient__bottom-rule {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(
      90deg,
      transparent 0%,
      rgba(220, 20, 60, 0.25) 40%,
      rgba(220, 20, 60, 0.25) 60%,
      transparent 100%
    );
  }

  @keyframes glowDrift {
    0%,
    100% {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1);
    }
    33% {
      opacity: 0.8;
      transform: translate(2%, 1.5%) scale(1.04);
    }
    66% {
      opacity: 0.9;
      transform: translate(-1%, -2%) scale(0.97);
    }
  }

  /* ── Left: Content ───────────────────────────────────── */
  .hero__content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    flex: 0 0 58%;
    max-width: 58%;
    padding-bottom: 48px;
  }

  /* Eyebrow */
  .hero__eyebrow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: revealUp 0.9s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) both 0.15s;
  }

  .eyebrow__dash {
    display: block;
    width: 26px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--primary-container);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .eyebrow__text {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: var(--primary-container);
  }

  .eyebrow__sep {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--outline-variant);
  }

  /* Name */
  .hero__name {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(52px, 7vw, 88px);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 0.88;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: revealUp 0.9s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) both 0.3s;
  }

  /* Bio block */
  .hero__bio-block {
    max-width: 80%;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: revealUp 0.9s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) both 0.45s;
  }

  .hero__bio-label {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: #ffffff;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .hero__location {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: rgba(200, 198, 197, 0.5);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .hero__location-icon {
    width: 13px;
    height: 13px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: var(--primary-container);
  }

  .hero__bio-lead {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #C8A45A;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .hero__bio {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #888888;
  }

  /* Skills */
  .hero__skills {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: revealUp 0.9s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) both 0.6s;
  }

  .skill {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--secondary);
    padding: 9px 22px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: 9999px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.025);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    cursor: default;
    transition:
      border-color 0.3s ease,
      color 0.3s ease,
      background 0.3s ease;
  }

  .skill:hover {
    border-color: rgba(220, 20, 60, 0.45);
    color: #ffffff;
    background: rgba(220, 20, 60, 0.06);
  }

  /* ── Right: Visual ───────────────────────────────────── */
  .hero__visual {
    position: absolute;
    right: 0;
    top: var(--nav-height);
    bottom: 0;
    width: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  /* Orb system */
  .orb {
    position: absolute;
    width: 360px;
    height: 360px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .orb__core {
    position: absolute;
    width: 180px;
    height: 180px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(
      circle at 38% 38%,
      rgba(220, 20, 60, 0.24) 0%,
      rgba(220, 20, 60, 0.07) 55%,
      transparent 75%
    );
    animation: orbBreath 8s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .orb__ring {
    position: absolute;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
  }

  .orb__ring--inner {
    width: 268px;
    height: 268px;
    border-color: rgba(220, 20, 60, 0.2);
    animation: ringCW 20s linear infinite;
  }

  .orb__ring--inner::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: -5px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 9px;
    height: 9px;
    background: var(--primary-container);
    border-radius: 50%;
    box-shadow:
      0 0 12px 3px rgba(220, 20, 60, 0.55),
      0 0 24px 6px rgba(220, 20, 60, 0.2);
  }

  .orb__ring--outer {
    width: 360px;
    height: 360px;
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045);
    animation: ringCCW 32s linear infinite;
  }

  .orb__ring--outer::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -3.5px;
    right: 18%;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  @keyframes orbBreath {
    0%,
    100% {
      transform: scale(1);
      opacity: 1;
    }
    50% {
      transform: scale(1.14);
      opacity: 0.7;
    }
  }

  @keyframes ringCW {
    from {
      transform: rotate(0deg);
    }
    to {
      transform: rotate(360deg);
    }
  }

  @keyframes ringCCW {
    from {
      transform: rotate(0deg);
    }
    to {
      transform: rotate(-360deg);
    }
  }

  /* ── Metric cards ────────────────────────────────────── */
  .metric {
    position: absolute;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
    backdrop-filter: blur(32px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(32px);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    padding: 18px 26px 16px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 5px;
    overflow: hidden;
    opacity: 0;
    transition:
      border-color 0.3s ease,
      background 0.3s ease;
    min-width: 148px;
  }

  .metric:hover {
    border-color: rgba(220, 20, 60, 0.38);
    background: rgba(220, 20, 60, 0.04);
  }

  .metric__accent {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 3px;
    height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(
      180deg,
      var(--primary-container) 0%,
      rgba(220, 20, 60, 0.1) 100%
    );
  }

  .metric__value {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .metric__label {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(160, 160, 160, 0.8);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .metric--roi {
    top: 14%;
    right: 14%;
    animation:
      revealUp 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) both 0.9s,
      floatY 6.5s ease-in-out infinite 1.7s;
  }

  .metric--brands {
    bottom: 20%;
    right: 7%;
    animation:
      revealUp 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) both 1.05s,
      floatY 7.5s ease-in-out infinite 1.85s;
  }

  .metric--growth {
    top: 50%;
    left: 4%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    animation:
      revealUpCentered 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) both 1.2s,
      floatYCentered 5.8s ease-in-out infinite 2s;
  }

  /* ── Scroll indicator ────────────────────────────────── */
  .hero__scroll {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 36px;
    left: var(--margin-desktop);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: revealUp 0.8s ease both 1.45s;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .scroll__label {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.24em;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22);
    writing-mode: vertical-rl;
    transform: rotate(180deg);
  }

  .scroll__bar {
    width: 1px;
    height: 52px;
    background: linear-gradient(
      to bottom,
      rgba(220, 20, 60, 0.65),
      transparent
    );
    transform-origin: top center;
    transform: scaleY(0);
    animation: scrollBarReveal 2.6s ease-in-out infinite 1.9s;
  }

  /* ── Shared animations ───────────────────────────────── */
  @keyframes revealUp {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(22px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  @keyframes revealUpCentered {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(calc(-50% + 22px));
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
    }
  }

  @keyframes floatY {
    0%,
    100% {
      transform: translateY(0px);
    }
    50% {
      transform: translateY(-10px);
    }
  }

  @keyframes floatYCentered {
    0%,
    100% {
      transform: translateY(-50%);
    }
    50% {
      transform: translateY(calc(-50% - 10px));
    }
  }

  @keyframes scrollBarReveal {
    0% {
      transform: scaleY(0);
      opacity: 1;
    }
    55% {
      transform: scaleY(1);
      opacity: 1;
    }
    100% {
      transform: scaleY(1);
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }

  /* ── Responsive ──────────────────────────────────────── */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero {
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      padding-left: var(--margin-mobile);
      padding-right: var(--margin-mobile);
      padding-bottom: 60px;
      gap: 56px;
    }

    .hero__content {
      flex: none;
      max-width: 100%;
      padding-bottom: 0;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .hero__eyebrow {
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .hero__bio-block {
      max-width: 100%;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .hero__location {
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .hero__skills {
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .hero__name {
      font-size: clamp(44px, 12vw, 64px);
    }

    .hero__visual {
      position: relative;
      right: auto;
      top: auto;
      bottom: auto;
      width: 100%;
      height: 280px;
    }

    .orb {
      width: 220px;
      height: 220px;
    }

    .orb__core {
      width: 110px;
      height: 110px;
    }
    .orb__ring--inner {
      width: 168px;
      height: 168px;
    }
    .orb__ring--outer {
      width: 220px;
      height: 220px;
    }

    .metric {
      min-width: 120px;
      padding: 14px 18px 12px;
    }

    .metric__value {
      font-size: 22px;
    }

    .metric--roi {
      top: 8%;
      right: 4%;
    }
    .metric--brands {
      bottom: 8%;
      right: 4%;
    }
    .metric--growth {
      top: 50%;
      left: 4%;
    }

    .hero__scroll {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
